Keep oldest, retained, next_sequence, overwritten, and the 16 records under one
spinlock. For a non-full append, use (oldest + retained) % capacity. For a full
append, replace oldest, advance oldest, and increment overwritten.

The show callback copies a complete bounded snapshot under the lock, unlocks,
then formats it. Record task_pid_nr(current) inside the typed event functions.
Call those functions only after a successful credential change or a selected
rmdir return.
